# Continental seed 101, 2 AIs, start epoch 9 (World War I, base ini start_epoch=9): P2 base ~80,52, P3 base ~38,38.
# Shelling (the playtester: citizens gather wood under his artillery): at minute 15 P2 gets 4 field artillery (101:
# range 14, area 1.75) and 6 machine gunners (121) at 56,44, the edge of P3's base; every 20 s the artillery attacks
# whatever of P3's is nearest to it within 15 tiles of 40,40, the machine gunners the nearest enemy within 30 tiles
# (stats engage). Do P3's citizens keep away (citizen_threats)? Measure P3's workers, losses.

defence(2, 0)
wait_until(15min)
spawn(2, unit.gun_artillery13_colossus, 56, 44, 4)
spawn(2, unit.inf10_machine_gun, 55, 46, 6)
every(0.33min, 15.10min, 29.95min, (run) => {
    stats("engage", 2, 56, 44, 30, unit.gun_artillery13_colossus, 40, 40)
    stats("engage", 2, 56, 44, 12)
})
